                <note rend="inline" type="source">861.00/6095: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in Japan</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Morris</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1920-01-10T15:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">January 10,
                                1920—3 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>10. Your 6, January 9, noon. See Department’s January 9, 4 p.m. No announcement
                    previous to this authorized or made so far as the Department is aware. Consul
                    had of course no information from this Department which was not furnished to
                    you.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
